OL,3,ANew Zealand to introduce bill for
OL,4,Aunder-16s social media ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew Zealand is to introduce a bill
OL,7,Fseeking to ban under-16s from using
OL,8,Fsocial media.
OL,10,FUnder the latest proposals, platforms
OL,11,Fincluding TikTok, Instagram, Snapchat
OL,12,Fand Facebook, will have to take steps
OL,13,Fto check users are over 16 and
OL,14,Fplatforms that fail to meet their
OL,15,Fobligations could face fines of up to
OL,16,F10% of their global revenue.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
