OL,3,ANew Zealand to introduce bill for
OL,4,Aunder-16s social media ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Christopher Luxon said
OL,7,Fsocial media was exposing children to
OL,8,F"harmful content, addictive technology
OL,9,Fand pressures they are not equipped to
OL,10,Fdeal with". But several political
OL,11,Fparties have said they will vote
OL,12,Fagainst the bill.
OL,14,FThe move follows a similar ban in
OL,15,FAustralia, while countries including
OL,16,Fthe UK and Greece are set to introduce
OL,17,Frestrictions next year.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
